WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.700
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's check on your agents.

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:07.043
The rail lists every agent in every session.

00:00:08.531 --> 00:00:10.691
Finished work waits for you, marked unread.

00:00:12.492 --> 00:00:14.332
A stuck agent jumps to the top.

00:00:15.464 --> 00:00:20.184
In the palette, type the at sign and the letter n to find whoever needs you.

00:00:20.735 --> 00:00:23.055
Answer it, and it gets right back to work.

00:00:26.815 --> 00:00:29.455
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
